{"id": "3031853", "revid": "41997", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3031853", "title": "Katia Winter", "text": "Katia Winter () o actri\u021b\u0103 suedez\u0103. Ea este cel mai bine cunoscut\u0103 pentru rolurile sale ca Nadia \u00een serialul Showtime \"Dexter\" (2012), Katrina Crane \u00een serialul Fox \"Sleepy Hollow\" (2013\u201315), Freyd\u00eds Eir\u00edksd\u00f3ttir \u00een serialul The CW \"Legends of Tomorrow\" (2017\u201318) \u0219i ca Gwen Karlsson \u00een serialul CBS/Paramount+ \"Blood &amp; Treasure\" (2019\u20132023). Ea a ap\u0103rut \u0219i \u00een serialul satiric cu supereroi \"The Boys\" de pe Amazon Prime Video ca r\u0103uf\u0103c\u0103toarea Mica Nina (2019\u2013prezent)."}
