{"id": "3033318", "revid": "229683", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3033318", "title": "Marinica Tepi\u0107", "text": "Marinica Tepi\u0107 (n\u0103scut\u0103 Ciobanu; s\u00e2rb\u0103 \"\u041c\u0430\u0440\u0438\u043d\u0438\u043a\u0430 \u0422\u0435\u043f\u0438\u045b (\u0427\u043e\u0431\u0430\u043d\u0443)\"; ) un om politic \u0219i fost jurnalist s\u00e2rb de etnie rom\u00e2n\u0103. Este o figur\u0103 proeminent\u0103 a opozi\u021biei fa\u021b\u0103 de Aleksandar Vu\u010di\u0107 \u0219i partidul acestuia Partidului Progresist S\u00e2rb. Ea a fost unul dintre vice-pre\u0219edin\u021bii partidului Libertate \u0219i Justi\u021bie, \u00eencep\u00e2nd cu anul 2019."}
